{"id":"525910430","kind":"article","title":"学成强欲","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Rage_to_master"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2022-06-08","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":26,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":563,"keywords":["学成强欲","学习动机","学习内驱力","儿童压力","心流"],"summary":"译文将“学成强欲”描述为儿童因内在兴趣而长时间练习并精进的倾向。作者认为这种投入依赖健康的学习内驱力，但儿童压力、日托、早教和扭曲奖励等环境因素可能削弱它，导致成年后深度投入看似只属于少数人；文末将其与心流相联系。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/525910430","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"8I_rfZZP\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.bc.edu/bc-web/schools/mcas/departments/psychology/people/faculty-directory/ellen-winner.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ellen Winner 博士</a>将<b>学成强欲</b>定义为儿童对某些快乐的活动有过分投入，如拉小提琴。这种痴迷致使儿童可以数小时地持续实践直至学有所成。<b>学成强欲</b>的根本，是健康而丰富的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，这是可以培养的。我们倾向于认为<b>学成强欲</b>是孩子与生俱来的本领，但现状是，许多孩子的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>因为负面的心理因素而丧失，而这些心理因素是外界环境导致的。我们不应该求老天保佑孩子生来就有<b>学成强欲</b>，而应为他们营造一个能培养<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>、减少损耗的最佳条件。童年的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stress_resilience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">慢性压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>是孩子学习内驱力的头号敌人，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Daycare_misery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日托</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>和早教是孩子（不考虑疾病等因素）的主要压力来源。此外，这些学校的教育给定的是一个<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Destructive_impact_of_praise_in_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">扭曲的奖励系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，它会重新调制了大脑，使其难受到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的激励。之后的年龄里，学校逐渐让大多数孩子的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>枯萎。因此，到了成年时，<b>学成强欲</b>是少数天选之子的特权。到那个阶段，它等同于诱发<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Simple_formula_for_happiness\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「心流」</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>（由 Mihály Csikszentmihalyi 所定义）。</p><p data-pid=\"j-XWD_Jr\">另见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"fUvvQJLZ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Trading_genius_for_Asperger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">把天才视为 Asperger</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"xjNNIljW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Precocity_paradox\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">早熟悖论</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"pehxayT6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制 <br/>题图 by ryosioss <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Rage_to_master\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rage to master - supermemo.guru</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 慢性压力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"426177682\" href=\"#/post/426177682\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 幼儿园的苦难 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"73366114\" href=\"#/post/73366114\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 表扬如何毁掉学习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"620721614\" href=\"#/post/620721614\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 实现幸福的简单公式 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"593177804\" href=\"#/post/593177804\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 把天才视为阿斯伯格（Asperger） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"599379155\" href=\"#/post/599379155\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 早熟悖论 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"439795148\" href=\"#/post/439795148\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"525125666","title":"Gray：美国的强制学校教育系统很快就会崩溃","author":"Peter Gray","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"521558437","title":"通过抽签验证的学券系统","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":13,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"73366114","title":"17 托儿所的苦难","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":27,"minutes":8,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"593177804","title":"实现幸福的简单公式","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":107,"minutes":18,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2671988597","title":"一个人该怎样找到自己真正热爱和擅长的事，并以此规划自己的人生？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":191,"minutes":4,"reason"